{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14461","headline":"寄禅师寺华上人次韵三首 二 · 戴叔伦","name":"寄禅师寺华上人次韵三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"禅心如落叶，不逐晓风颠。\n猊坐翻萧瑟，臯比喜接连。\n芙蓉开紫雾，湘玉映清泉。\n白昼谈经罢，闲从石上眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14461.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14461","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}